n Brent will charge a refresher which I anticipate will be =C2=A38,000. My fees =
will be incurred on an hourly basis. Brent will then proceed to draft the co=
urt=E2=80=99s order but that will be a simple process of translating the judgment =
of the court into the court=E2=80=99s order.&nbsp; It will not be a case of trying=
 to renegotiate or relitigate what the Judge has decided. <o:p></o:p></span>=
</i></p><p class=3D"MsoNormal"><i><span style=3D"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&q=
