in-left:36.0pt"><i><span style=3D"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quo=
t;,sans-serif">To reiterate, the fees which would be incurred to attend a he=
aring where judgment is handed down to be in the region of =C2=A35,000 for me an=
d =C2=A38,000 for Brent. There will also be my fees incurred on an hourly rate f=
or any work I do with Brent and you on the order. This may be 6 hours work a=
t around =C2=A33k. The total cost will be =C2=A316,000 on the basis that there is a =
hearing for the judgment. Less if there is not but at present we do not know=
 how judgment will be handed down.<o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class=3D"MsoNor=
